# Repository Scope

This repository is the **authenticated SettleRate application** (`settlerate-app`): auth, `/app/*`, calculator, scenarios, comparisons, billing, Supabase persistence.

It is **not** the marketing site. Prohibited-route rules below apply **only here** — do not generalize them to `settlerate-web` or other repos.

Authority: `docs/APP_SCOPE.md`.

## Prohibited routes (this repo only)

Never reintroduce: `/pricing`, `/how-it-works`, `/terms`, `/privacy`, `/contact`, `/approach`, `/advisors`, `/investors`, `/documentation`, `/regulatory`.

## Security — `docs/SECURITY_MODEL.md`

- RLS required on all user data tables; no cross-user access
- Authorize via JWT + RLS; never trust client-provided user IDs
- Admin via `user_roles` + `has_role()` only
- Service role key never in client

## Roles and entitlements — `docs/ROLES_AND_ENTITLEMENTS.md`

- Entitlement gating is server-side; client checks are UI hints only
- No advisor multi-client features without explicit design approval

## Copy — `docs/COPY_STANDARD.md`

- Neutral, institutional, non-promotional
- Use canonical product identity sentences verbatim where defining SettleRate
- Forbidden terms: best, optimize, recommend, predict, you should, etc.

## UI — `docs/UI_STANDARD.md`, `docs/PORTAL_UI_STANDARD.md`

- Institutional, calm, ledger-style surfaces; design tokens only
- Phase 2 UI changes allowed only when **required by approved financial methodology** — no visual redesign
